It is nighttime.
I am in my flat.
I am standing by the open window.
It is not raining now.
The air is very cool and fresh.
There is no heat at all now.
There was very harsh sunlight in the morning.
But now the weather is very nice.
The weather will be nice tomorrow too.
Maybe it will rain tomorrow too.
I look at the street below.
The street is completely wet.
There is water on the street.
The trees also look very clean and green.
I like this cool weather very much.
I drink a cup of tea.
I peacefully watch this quiet city.
